"text": "I chose this brown belted blazer to define your waist and draw the eye upward, paired with olive flared trousers that give your silhouette a strong vertical line while softening your hips. The dark brown mesh ballet flats add texture and comfort for your morning movement, and the small ginger leather bag carries just enough everyday essentials without weighing you down.",
"how_to_wear": [
"Wear the blazer unbuttoned or with the belt loosely tied so it does not restrict your range of motion."
