"text": "This brown single-breasted blazer features a structured lapel and a built-in drawstring waist that cinches gently to accentuate your figure."
},
{
"n": "#35·08",
"text": "The olive green flared trousers are made from bi-flex fabric, offering a high-rise waist and a wide leg that flows comfortably around your hips and legs."
},
{
"n": "#107·03",
"text": "These dark brown ballet flats combine suede panels with an open mesh front and feature a polished gold buckle strap across the instep for a touch of refined detail."
},
{
